Alright, here we go

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:37.020
To see the joy it brings so many people faces.
It's amazing, you know?

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:38.520
If they didn't watch, if they weren't fans...

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:42.420
...we would have nothing to do so, it's our way of kind of saying thank you

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:48.480
If you ended up on the iron throne what would be the first law you would pass

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:50.640
That women could be knights

