If, there are one character (Hodor) you wish haven't been killed, who would it be?

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.560
I just really loved working with...

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.720
...Jack Gleeson so much that I have to say Joffrey...

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:09.240
...He was so fun to hate

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:14.520
It's a show made by grown-ups for grown-ups, and we take chances

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:20.220
This season, especially, everyone's kind of congregating to team up against the oncoming threat

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:24.400
You can feel the momentum building.  Lots of stuff coming to a head

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.140
Alliances are being forged, alliances are being broken...

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:28.900
...It's all picking up

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.220
It's only gonna get bigger and better

